        <mxCell id="GiN7814p2XpSQrApLdXe-29" value="The using components needs to be in an own container otherwise the extension would not work (extensions needs to be outside of the same parent). With layers the usage direction is clear." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
